<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/msa@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/msa@/~part_III__cl_18__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Seseorang yang tidak mematuhi subseksyen (5) adalah melakukan suatu kesalahan."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/msa@/~part_III__cl_19> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/msa@/~part_III> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/21/msa@> .
